 "remarks": "Welcome to this beautifully maintained, move-in-ready 2-bedroom, 2-full-bath condo in the sought-after Portal Rock community in Cos Cob! Bright, light-filled interiors feature hardwood floors, a wood-burning fireplace, and an inviting kitchen with white cabinetry and stainless steel appliances. The finished lower level (2025) offers versatile space for a den, office, or recreation room, plus a second full bath. Enjoy a private stone patio overlooking lush green space. Improvements include replacement windows (2022), a new dishwasher (2026), and water heater (2026). Two assigned parking spaces and a convenient location near the Cos Cob train station, shops, and restaurants complete this wonderful home!",
